to track down the wanted ISIS leader \"the Jordanian,\" navigating a city plagued by executions, bombings, and violence."},{"language":"es-ES","title":"Raqa","overview":"En las peligrosas calles de Raqa, el espía internacional, Haibala (alias El Saharaui), intenta dar caza a El Jordano, uno de los jefes del ISIS más buscados del momento. No es el único infiltrado en Siria. Malika, una enfermera de Ceuta al servicio de la Europol, ha llegado a Raqa con el mismo propósito. En un escenario marcado por las ejecuciones sumarias, la esclavitud de las mujeres y los bombardeos, Haibala y Malika intentarán cada uno por su lado cumplir con su misión: localizar y entregar al cabecilla de la organización fundamentalista y precipitar la caída del ISIS."}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/g1fMCVuf3xrCTF0AFmHz93MdfeW.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/pYe8myfqBXypkm77jROAbTigEb.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":1239481,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"es-ES","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/g1fMCVuf3xrCTF0AFmHz93MdfeW.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/g1fMCVuf3xrCTF0AFmHz93MdfeW.jpg","language":"it","width":1200,"height":1600},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/g1fMCVuf3xrCTF0AFmHz93MdfeW.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/g1fMCVuf3xrCTF0AFmHz93MdfeW.jpg","language":"it","width":1200,"height":1600}]},"en":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jDzliBDT3xuNnifOX8qBIAJI8oA.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/jDzliBDT3xuNnifOX8qBIAJI8oA.jpg","language":"en","width":2000,"height":3000},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jDzliBDT3xuNnifOX8qBIAJI8oA.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image